  "notes": "Fire Tester 0.1.703b adjusts the TLSF main-frame request to align the 115200 logical-pixel framebuffer plus 12 poison bytes to 4096 bytes, then subtracts the poison area: 118772 requested bytes with 3572 bytes of internal padding. The earlier 114676-byte free-fit observation reflects SDK rounding, not a persistent 524-byte allocation. Logical pixels remain 115200, the BLE heap floor is unchanged, and the existing frame-range trace remains enabled for diagnostics. This is a candidate fix pending runtime validation; no hardware acceptance claim is made.",
